# Mirrou Creative Studio — Environment Variables
#
# The website currently requires NO runtime secrets.
# Rendering is fully static (vite-react-ssg) and served via nginx on Cloud Run.
#
# Add project-specific variables here as integrations are introduced, e.g.:
#   - a consent-gated analytics measurement ID (DSGVO: only after consent)
#   - a HubSpot portal / form ID for the contact form
#
# Never commit real .env files — copy this to .env.local for local overrides.
